ke is complete.'],['q'=>'What is the difference between the packages?','a'=>'Basic (R4,600): Intake checklist; starter output; editable file or portal-generated output; one action note; next-step recommendation. Standard (R11,000): Expanded output; implementation checklist; editable pack; one review where applicable; related Sprint recommendation. Premium (R22,500): Executive-level output; advisory review where applicable; presentation/dashboard extract or extended pack where applicable; two reviews where applicable.'],['q'=>'What do you need from me?','a'=>'Contact details; Organisation details; Country; Sector; Buyer type; Business stage; Service-specific information; Supporting documents; Consent where applicable.'],['q'=>'Is a revision included?','a'=>'Each package includes the review route stated in its scope. Extra revisions can be added as an optional add-on.'],['q'=>'Are prices VAT inclusive?','a'=>'No. Prices are VAT-exclusive; VAT at 15% is stated separately at checkout. Vendor, licence and government fees are not included unless stated.']]],'featured'=>false,'popular'=>false,'is_new'=>false],
